    {
      "id": "claim_061ac9d9556e4365ac61513743ac2b1a",
      "statement": "In extension mode, CliBrowser.ensureAttached() gates the attach with requireRunningBrowser(target): it inventories OS processes (ps -A -o comm= on POSIX, tasklist /FO CSV /NH on Windows) and refuses to invoke the CLI extension attach if the configured browser process is absent, because the CLI extension attach would otherwise open its connection URL through the browser executable and spawn a browser; CDP never launches.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://skills/website-automation-builder/assets/site-template/src/runtime/cli-browser.ts#L156-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:02fb38b9d7e8078b9bef146d50133607bb743d9beee8618d43d0d68bee6f858b:"
