      "statement": "The integration is tested without launching a real browser: tests/cli-browser.test.ts covers the version pin, named-session attach/reuse, BROWSER_REQUIRED/ATTACH_FAILED mapping, bundle integrity, and the run-code --raw double-decode round-trip, and the demo project (assets/demo/tests/runtime.integration.test.ts) runs the full CLI against a fake Playwright CLI (fake-playwright-cli.mjs) and a fixture server covering missing browser, failed attach, named-session reuse, CDP configuration, compact observation, and run-code result mapping.",
