      "statement": "The meta setup skill (.agents/skills/setup) and its audit (scripts/check.mjs, references/requirements.md) require the Playwright CLI to be exactly 0.1.19 (PLAYWRIGHT_CLI_VERSION), install only what is missing (npm install -g @playwright/cli@0.1.19), treat the browser/extension install as a manual user action, and never run playwright-cli attach or open or modify the browser automatically; an unexpected CLI version is treated as incompatible, not an invitation to upgrade.",
