    {
      "id": "claim_704050300e1a4b9fa7e6868a3b79e84c",
      "statement": "The runtime's integration-specific error codes are CLI_PROTOCOL (exit 4, recovery repair) for unexpected CLI results or wrong version, ATTACH_FAILED (exit 3, recovery user-action) for attach/session failures, and BROWSER_REQUIRED (exit 3, recovery user-action) for an absent configured browser; these are typed AutomationErrors with a code, step, and deterministic recovery strategy.",
